君子，用心之不壹也。","targetNotes":"篇首序文。","sourceLabel":"第 273 页","sourceNotes":"据第 273 页《鳲鳩》篇首序义。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"陈奂","sectionLabel":"疏"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":6,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"鳲鳩在桑，其子七兮。淑人君子，其儀一兮。其儀一兮，心如結兮。","targetNotes":"首章。","sourceLabel":"第 273 页","sourceNotes":"据第 273 页首章疏义。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"陈奂","sectionLabel":"疏"}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":6,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"鳲鳩在桑，其子在梅。淑人君子，其帶伊絲。其帶伊絲，其弁伊騏。","targetNotes":"第二章。","sourceLabel":"第 274 页","sourceNotes":"据第 274 页第二章疏义。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"陈奂","sectionLabel":"疏"}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":6,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"鳲鳩在桑，其子在棘。淑人君子，其儀不忒。其儀不忒，正是四國。","targetNotes":"第三章。","sourceLabel":"第 275 页","sourceNotes":"据第 275 页第三章疏义。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"陈奂","sectionLabel":"疏"}]},{"id":"0005","order":5,"total":6,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"鳲鳩在桑，其子在榛。淑人君子，正是國人。正是國人，胡不萬年。","targetNotes":"第四章。","sourceLabel":"第 275 页","sourceNotes":"据第 275 页第四章疏义。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0005-1","attributionLabel":"陈奂","sectionLabel":"疏"}]},{"id":"0006","order":6,"total":6,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"鳲鳩四章章六句","targetNotes":"章句总说。","sourceLabel":"第 275 页","sourceNotes":"据第 275 页章句总说。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0006-1","attributionLabel":"陈奂","sectionLabel":"疏"}]}]}}}
